zstd 1.5.7 (https://github.com/facebook/zstd, BSD licence: LICENSE), as its own single-file build makes it:
build/single_file_libs/create_single_file_library.sh -> zstd.c; zstd.h and zstd_errors.h from lib/. Release tarball
sha256 eb33e51f49a15e023950cd7825ca74a4a2b43db8354825ac24fc1b7ee09e6fa3.

Compiled into the module (cmake/AnimusLibDependency.cmake) so a realm needs no zstd installed; its symbols are
hidden, so it never stands in for the system libzstd that the MySQL client library links.
